        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Whit Stillman, Greta Gerwig, Adam Brody, Analeigh Tipton, Taylor Nichols\n- Products: Damsels in Distress, Love & Friendship\n- Roles: actress, filmmaker, actor, writer, director\n\nFacts:\n- Taylor Nichols was born as Cecil Taylor Nichols on March 3, 1959, in Louisville, Kentucky.\n- Greta Gerwig was born on August 4, 1983, and she is an American actress and filmmaker.\n- Damsels in Distress is an American comedy film with the original titles Violet Wister's Damsels in Distress and Whit Stillman's Damsels in Distress.\n- Damsels in Distress was written and directed by Whit Stillman and stars Greta Gerwig, Adam Brody, and Analeigh Tipton.\n- Taylor Nichols is an American actor best known for roles in Whit Stillman films including Metropolitan, Barcelona, The Last Days of Disco, and Damsels in Distress.\n- Love & Friendship is a 2016 period comedy film written and directed by Whit Stillman.",
